---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";

const lastUpdated = "24 Jan 2026";
---

<Layout title={`Privacy | intrebit`}>
    <div class="legal">
        <header class="legal__header">
            <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
            <p class="legal__meta">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
        </header>

        <section class="legal__section">
            <p>
                We keep things simple. We don’t sell data, we don’t run creepy trackers, and we only collect
                what we need to run this website.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="legal__section">
            <h2>What we collect</h2>
            <p>
                When you visit <strong>intrebit.com</strong>, our hosting provider (Cloudflare) may
                automatically collect basic technical information such as:
            </p>
            <ul>
                <li>IP address (usually in logs)</li>
                <li>browser type + device info</li>
                <li>pages visited + approximate location (based on IP)</li>
                <li>performance and security signals</li>
            </ul>
            <p>This data helps keep the site fast, secure, and working properly.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="legal__section">
            <h2>What we don’t do</h2>
            <ul>
                <li>No advertising trackers</li>
                <li>No selling or renting personal data</li>
                <li>No user profiles</li>
                <li>No “follow you around the internet” stuff</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="legal__section">
            <h2>Cookies</h2>
            <p>
                We don’t use cookies for marketing or tracking. Cloudflare may use essential cookies
                strictly for security and performance.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="legal__section">
            <h2>Third-party services</h2>
            <p>
                Right now we don’t embed third-party tracking tools. If we ever add something like analytics
                or a booking tool, we’ll update this page.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="legal__section">
            <h2>Contact</h2>
            <p>
                If you email us, we’ll only use your message to reply. We don’t add you to mailing lists
                unless you explicitly ask.
            </p>
            <p>
                <a class="legal__link" href="mailto:hello@intrebit.com">hello@intrebit.com</a>
            </p>
        </section>
    </div>
</Layout>